<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-058" chapter-id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu" source-id="s-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu">
  <p id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:zhou" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">至<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:zhou:m0001" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDA">王廙</persName>去職，詔以<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:zhou:m0008" ref="c6b_s71_vt7">訪</persName>爲荊州。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">其從事中郎<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo:m0005" ref="nyu_drp_roe">郭舒</persName>説<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo:m0008" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>曰：「鄙州雖遇寇難荒弊，實爲用武之國，若以假人，將有尾大之患，公宜自領，<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo:m0045" ref="c6b_s71_vt7">訪</persName>爲梁州足矣。」<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo:m0053" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>從之，<persName id="c-jinshu-058-jin043-guoshu:guo:m0057" ref="c6b_s71_vt7">訪</persName>大怒。</p>
</text>
